  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S. Bihar State Milk Co-Operative vs The State Of Jharkhand & Others on 12 October, 2019",
    "facts": "The State, in their supplementary counter affidavit, at paragraphs 8 and 9, have categorically given a statement that they have written a letter to the Registrar General of this Court and also had given a reminder seeking approval. It has been mentioned that the matter will be placed before the Cabinet only after approval is received from the High Court of Jharkhand at Ranchi.",
    "arguments": "Section 70(3) and the proviso thereto prescribes that the Presiding Officer of the Tribunal shall be a person, who has been a District Judge.",
